夕阳下，阿九挺直了腰杆，灰色短衫被风吹动。他脖子上那块**断剑吊坠**熠熠生辉。\n\n**【桥段应用：身份线索猜测/绝技反差】**\n**阿九**\n（【对白风格：冷峻型】，握住了腰间的断头竹木剑）\n“既然敢动我的人……那就准备好付出代价。”\n\n**【动作行】**\n远处房顶，黑色孟买猫**神秘人**正紧了紧身上的紫色斗篷，子母双剑在夜行服后若隐若现。\n\n**神秘人**\n（金色的瞳孔收缩）\n“那种步法……果然是他。御猫堂最凶狠的‘九命残剑’。”\n\n**【过场】**\n**切至：黑屏**\n**字幕：第一集 完** \n 开始创作，制作故事短片“““\n\n请按照任务步骤执行，无需理解用户的原始诉求里非绘画风格的描述","agentName":"短片风格助理"},"name":"call_task_agent"}],"additional_kwargs":{"agentId":"9df768f0-a221-4667-a85c-ff8c48884025","agentName":"艺术总监","uniqueKey":"workflow.filmdirector.askFilmStyleTrigger","messageType":"codewrite_tool_call","currentRetryCount":1,"messageStatus":1},"response_metadata":{},"invalid_tool_calls":[]},"type":"ai"},{"data":{"id":"tool_result_mock_tool_call:74585b6e-fe66-4f5f-b517-8801a453775a","content":"{“content“:[{“text“:“```hide\\n\\n[[[selectFilmStyleTrigger\\n{\\“options\\“:[{\\“image\\“:\\“https://static-hoe.hogi.ai/style_recommends/style1103new37.jpg\\“,\\“intention\\“:\\“CONTINUE\\“,\\“title\\“:\\“火柴人\\“,\\“value\\“:\\“{\\\\\\“filmGenImageTool\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“generate_image_nano\\\\\\“,\\\\\\“filmStyleTrigger\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“Animated Stick Figure style,no text or watermark\\\\\\“,\\\\\\“styleName\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“Webcomic\\\\\\“}\\“},{\\“image\\“:\\“https://static-hoe.hogi.ai/style_recommends/style1103new35.jpg\\“,\\“intention\\“:\\“CONTINUE\\“,\\“title\\“:\\“诡萌幻想绘本\\“,\\“value\\“:\\“{\\\\\\“filmGenImageTool\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“generate_image_midjourney\\\\\\“,\\\\\\“filmStyleTrigger\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“--niji 6 --chaos 5 --sref 1454511430 --style raw --sw 200 --stylize 500 --personalize f6uynmu\\\\\\“,\\\\\\“styleName\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“Spooky-Cute\\\\\\“}\\“},{\\“image\\“:\\“https://static-hoe.hogi.ai/style_recommends/xianxiafantasy1208.jpg\\“,\\“intention\\“:\\“CONTINUE\\“,\\“title\\“:\\“3D国创\\“,\\“value\\“:\\“{\\\\\\“filmGenImageTool\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“generate_image_seedream45\\\\\\“,\\\\\\“filmStyleTrigger\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“3D，国风,CG风格,凡人修仙传3D风格，CG，\\\\\\“,\\\\\\“styleName\\\\\\“:\\\\\\“Xianxia 3D\\\\\\“}\\“},{\\“image\\“:\\“https://static-hoe.hogi.ai/s